In order to bring home the guilt of the accused under aforesaid provisions, the prosecution is required to establish following ingredients : (1) That the death of the woman was caused by any burns or bodily injury or in some circumstances which were not normal;
(2) such death occurs within 7 years from the date of her marriage;
S.C.No. 57/10 Page 27 of 54 pages State Vs Anand Sharma etc.
(3) that the victim was subjected to cruelty or harassment by her husband or any relative of her husband;
(4) such cruelty or harassment should be for or in connection with demand of dowry; and (5) that such cruelty and harassment was made soon before her death.
48.
